  "description": "Available for long-term rent from September 2026.\n\nDue to the large number of inquiries, if interested, please e-mail with information about yourself, such as:\n\n1. How many people will be staying in the house.\n2. When would you like to move in, and for how long do you plan to stay?\n\nThis is a beautiful renovated period house in Salthill that has 3 bedrooms and 2 large living rooms, a large bathroom with period style furnishings upstairs. Downstairs a kitchen, separate dining room, living room or an additional 4th bedroom, garage, utility room and another toilet with shower.\nThere's a large private back garden.\nThere's private parking for one car with ample parking for more on street.\nLocation wise the house is on the Galway side of Salthill village, 2 minutes from Salthill Promenade & beach, about 5 minutes walk from the centre of Salthill, and about 20 minutes walk (5 minute drive) from Galway city centre. There's also a scenic coastal walk/cycle track into Galway city that takes a little longer.\n5 min drive to Galway University Hospital.\nThe house is in a quiet cul de sac, in a neighbourhood in one of Galway's most sought after locations. There's a grocery store 50m, and petrol station 70m away.\nOil Fired Central Heating. Wired for Sky TV upstairs.\n\nNo smoking.",
